# 17. Fallback if Structured Output Is Unreliable

If the existing Planner cannot reliably generate all three fields in one response, do NOT immediately perform new SFT.

Instead use three controlled Planner calls:

### Conflict call

```text
Given the image, identify the central expectation violation or script opposition.
```

### Association call

```text
Given the image and conflict, explore multiple remote but relevant concepts,
social meanings, analogies, and semantic associations that could support humor.
```

### Mechanism call

```text
Given the image, conflict, and associations, identify an effective humor mechanism
or resolution.
```

Use the same Planner checkpoint.

This provides:

[
H_C,H_A,H_M
]

without changing Planner weights.

